title: November 2026

@left_realign_2026
# prose-audit: Grade B — Strong congress framing and a properly authored result, but three of the four merger routes carry no prose at all: federation, Rozwój+ merger and grand merger each set a target string and jump to the tally. Only the keep-allies branch is written.
title: A strong Left convenes the realignment congress
subtitle: Invited centrists, Greens and developmental conservatives decide whether one party is viable
face-image: img/poland/events/lewica-convention-2024.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 30
order: 5
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2026 and month = 11 and sld_partocracy_stage < 1 and left_poll >= 13 and (left_realign_invite_p2050 = 1 or left_realign_invite_greens = 1 or left_realign_invite_rozwoj = 1)
on-arrival: {!
const federationLegacy = Q.federation_successful ||
    Q.federation_peaceful_unification;
const federationReachBonus = federationLegacy
    ? 8
    : (String(Q.left_merger_structure) == "federation"
        ? Math.max(
            -6,
            3 - (Number(Q.federation_veto_pressure) || 0) * 0.6 -
                (Number(Q.federation_brand_dilution) || 0) * 0.5
        )
        : 0);
Q.left_realign_strength_score = Math.round(
    (Number(Q.left_poll) || 0) * 2 +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.party_system_left_pull) || 0) * 0.35 +
    (Number(Q.party_unity) || 0) * 0.15 +
    (Number(Q.public_trust) || 0) * 0.10 +
    federationReachBonus
);
Q.left_realign_social_mood = Math.round(
    35 + ((Number(Q.social_spending_support) || 50) - 50) * 0.35 +
    ((Number(Q.economic_issue_salience) || 40) -
        (Number(Q.cultural_issue_salience) || 30)) * 0.25 +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.party_system_left_pull) || 0) * 0.12
);
const invitedGreens = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
    return record.id == "greens";
});
Q.left_realign_p2050_score = Math.round(
    (Number(Q.p2050_relation) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, 5 - (Number(Q.p2050_vote_intent) || 0)) * 4 +
    Q.left_realign_strength_score * 0.12 -
    (Number(Q.p2050_coalition_dissent) || 0) * 0.20 +
    federationReachBonus * 0.8
);
Q.left_realign_greens_score = Math.round(
    (Number(invitedGreens && invitedGreens.relation) || 0) +
    Q.left_realign_strength_score * 0.18 +
    Q.left_realign_social_mood * 0.10 +
    federationReachBonus
);
Q.left_realign_rozwoj_score = Math.round(
    (Number(Q.rozwoj_relation) || 0) +
    Q.left_realign_strength_score * 0.16 +
    (Number(Q.left_right_score) || 0) * 0.22 -
    (Number(Q.cultural_issue_salience) || 0) * 0.12 +
    federationReachBonus * 0.5
);
Q.left_realign_p2050_accepted =
    Q.left_realign_invite_p2050 && Number(Q.p2050_seats) > 0 &&
    Q.left_realign_p2050_score >= 55 ? 1 : 0;
Q.left_realign_greens_accepted =
    Q.left_realign_invite_greens && invitedGreens && invitedGreens.active &&
    Q.left_realign_greens_score >= 55 ? 1 : 0;
Q.left_realign_rozwoj_accepted =
    Q.left_realign_invite_rozwoj && Number(Q.rozwoj_seats) > 0 &&
    Q.left_realign_rozwoj_score >= 48 ? 1 : 0;
Q.news_headline = "A strong Lewica tests whether its invitations can become one party";
!}

= November 2026 — From coalition arithmetic to one organisation

We have enough support to convene a congress, but not enough to command it.
Every invitation sent earlier now becomes a decision about dissolving a party,
its name and its parliamentary discipline into a common organisation.

[? if federation_successful = 1: The earlier federation supplies tested rules
for candidate selection, finance, local specialisation and protected identity.
Invited parties therefore see a record of plural organisation rather than only
a promise from Lewica headquarters.?][? if left_merger_structure = "federation"
and federation_successful = 0: The old federal vetoes and competing brands are
also in the room; legal pluralism has not yet proved that it can decide.?][? if
federation_peaceful_unification = 1: The party already showed that a federation
can unify by member consent while preserving its currents.?]

[? if left_realign_invite_p2050 and left_realign_p2050_accepted: Poland 2050's
remaining MPs arrive ready to join. Independence no longer looks like a route
back to the Sejm.?][? if left_realign_invite_p2050 and not
left_realign_p2050_accepted: Poland 2050 accepts electoral cooperation but
refuses liquidation; its MPs still distrust rule from Lewica headquarters.?]
[? if left_realign_invite_greens and left_realign_greens_accepted: The Greens
accept an internal current with their programme and organisers intact.?][? if
left_realign_invite_greens and not left_realign_greens_accepted: The Greens
will share candidates, not their legal identity.?] [? if
left_realign_invite_rozwoj and left_realign_rozwoj_accepted: Rozwój+ believes a
party built around work, welfare and investment can contain its developmental
conservatives.?][? if left_realign_invite_rozwoj and not
left_realign_rozwoj_accepted: Rozwój+ fears that cultural disputes would leave
its MPs as permanent guests on the Left.?]

- @realign_social_federation
- @realign_rozwoj_merger
- @realign_grand_merger
- @realign_keep_allies

@realign_social_federation
title: Unite the invited Poland 2050 and Green currents under Wspólna Polska
view-if: left_realign_invite_p2050 = 1 or left_realign_invite_greens = 1
choose-if: left_realign_strength_score >= 48 and left_realign_social_mood >= 38 and (left_realign_p2050_accepted = 1 or left_realign_greens_accepted = 1)
unavailable-subtitle: The invited organisations still prefer a loose electoral pact.
on-arrival: {!
const targets = [];
if (Q.left_realign_p2050_accepted) targets.push("Poland 2050");
if (Q.left_realign_greens_accepted) targets.push("Zieloni");
Q.left_realign_targets = targets.join(" and ");
!}
go-to: left_realign_result

@realign_rozwoj_merger
title: Merge with Rozwój+ around work, welfare and investment
view-if: left_realign_invite_rozwoj = 1
choose-if: left_realign_strength_score >= 48 and left_right_score >= 42 and cultural_issue_salience <= 50 and rozwoj_relation >= 24 and left_realign_rozwoj_accepted = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The conservative edge or developmental trust is not strong enough.
on-arrival: left_realign_targets = "Rozwój+"
