@realign_grand_merger
title: Fold Poland 2050, Zieloni and Rozwój+ into one broad party
view-if: left_realign_invite_p2050 = 1 and left_realign_invite_greens = 1 and left_realign_invite_rozwoj = 1
choose-if: left_realign_strength_score >= 60 and left_realign_social_mood >= 42 and left_right_score >= 42 and cultural_issue_salience <= 50 and left_realign_p2050_accepted = 1 and left_realign_greens_accepted = 1 and left_realign_rozwoj_accepted = 1
unavailable-subtitle: A three-way merger needs a dominant Left and a material rather than cultural electoral axis.
on-arrival: left_realign_targets = "Poland 2050, Zieloni and Rozwój+"
