@constructive_sikorski_dismiss
title: Call it ordinary parliamentary arithmetic
subtitle: Treat the warnings as theatre and leave the named compact's starting count intact.
view-if: constructive_candidate = "Radosław Sikorski"
on-arrival: konf_normalisation += 4; public_trust -= 2; minority_safety -= 3; news_headline = "Lewica dismisses the Sikorski–Konfederacja compact as arithmetic"

The leadership says every opposition talks before a confidence vote and
refuses to make the annex the story. Registrars, hospital managers and equality
organisations hear something else: nobody in government intends to make the
price politically costly before the vote.

{!<div class="coalition-builder-host" data-coalition-mode="constructive"></div>!}

- @constructive_roll_2026: Bring the named replacement to a roll call

@constructive_morawiecki
