= The firewall was a coalition offer

Sikorski is sworn in before the democratic parties answer Lewica's calls.
KO keeps the premiership and most ministries; PSL and Poland 2050 keep their
institutional footholds; Konfederacja receives the economic ministries and a
written repeal calendar.

Every democratic partner insists that the compact is temporary and
constitutional. Every one of them has also chosen Konfederacja over continuing
government with Lewica. The old opposition relationships are over.

[? if trz_freebie_law = "marriage": The compact names marriage equality as its
first repeal target. Local registries begin preparing for non-enforcement before
the government has introduced a repeal bill.?][? if trz_freebie_law =
"abortion": The compact names abortion rights as its first repeal target.
Hospital managers begin preparing for non-enforcement before the government has
introduced a repeal bill.?]

