@sikorski_denounce_2026
title: Declare the democratic alliance dead
subtitle: Preserve a clear opposition line and accept total isolation from its former parties.
on-arrival: party_unity += 6; progressive_credibility += 4; public_trust -= 2; left_poll_momentum += 0.3; news_headline = "Lewica declares the old democratic alliance dead"
go-to: poland_event_queue

@sikorski_ledger_2026
title: Publish every vote and every cabinet promise
subtitle: Turn the betrayal into a permanent public record without reopening negotiations.
on-arrival: media_capacity += 5; public_trust += 2; constitutional_restraint += 2; coalition_blur -= 5; news_headline = "Lewica publishes the complete Sikorski–Konfederacja bargain"
go-to: poland_event_queue

@sikorski_mobilise_2026
title: Build a social opposition outside the democratic parties
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Prepare unions, tenants and equality organisations for the repeal session.
